cff-version: 1.2.0
message: If you use this framework, please cite it.
title: "How Regulatory Order Reaches Actors: A Five-Layer Framework"
abstract: >-
  A five-layer framework for tracing how regulatory order forms and reaches
  actors across AI-related value chains: semiconductors, computing, cloud,
  data centers. Layer A reads conditions and Layer B reads events as two
  independent classification axes; Layer C is downstream of both, describing
  how they leave a trace in the record; Layer D and Layer E describe
  distribution and re-formation once an order exists.
type: software
